  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to support India&#x2019;s transition to a low carbon economy that ensures sustainable and inclusive growth and at building climate resilience of the vulnerable communities. Most importantly, all project activities will aim at skilling and creating green jobs/livelihoods, which will be further bolstered by dedicated (i) capacity building for 1,000 youth in clean energy entrepreneurships and (ii) tailored trainings for 1,000 former coal-mine workers in diversified livelihoods.</narrative>
  </description>
